        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Midtown Manhattan, Lower Manhattan, New York\n- Buildings: 888 7th Avenue, 200 West Street\n- Companies: Goldman Sachs, Pershing Square Capital Management\n- People: Bill Ackman\n\nFacts:\n- 888 7th Avenue was completed in 1969 as a modern-style office skyscraper in Midtown Manhattan.\n- 888 7th Avenue is 628 feet tall and has 46 floors.\n- 200 West Street is the global headquarters of Goldman Sachs.\n- 200 West Street is a 749-foot, 44-story building on West Street between Vesey Street and Murray Street in Lower Manhattan.\n- Pershing Square Capital Management is an American hedge fund management company founded and run by Bill Ackman.\n- Pershing Square Capital Management is located at 888 7th Avenue in New York.",
